    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Passage is a first-person psychological horror game set in a storm-wrecked coastal village. Navigate flooded ruins, manipulate physics-based debris, and survive attacks from the drowned dead as you make your way towards the last lighthouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stranded at Sea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a rowboat, drifting through a ship graveyard in the middle of a storm. Your only landmark is the bright beam of a lighthouse in the distance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row through violent waters while thunder cracks overhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your lantern to navigate\u2014but its fuel is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather shifts as you make your way through the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map, no markers, just you and your lantern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.mp4?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Drowning Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remains of a flooded hamlet lay inland from the shore. Walkways collapse, water laps at your feet, and things don\u2019t stay the same as you left them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental challenges to progress through the floodwaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stave off the hallucinations of the village's previous inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack crates and debris to reach higher ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore basements, corridors, and homes lost to the sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.mp4?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Beacon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse still towers above the ruins. Weather-beaten, gutted, but somehow still running.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the drowned dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes and defenses left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way to the top of the last lighthouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/cee44879831100e312215b14d7fa8c14.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/cee44879831100e312215b14d7fa8c14.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/cee44879831100e312215b14d7fa8c14.mp4?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Passage is a first-person psychological horror game set in a storm-wrecked coastal village. Navigate flooded ruins, manipulate physics-based debris, and survive attacks from the drowned dead as you make your way towards the last lighthouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stranded at Sea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a rowboat, drifting through a ship graveyard in the middle of a storm. Your only landmark is the bright beam of a lighthouse in the distance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Row through violent waters while thunder cracks overhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your lantern to navigate\u2014but its fuel is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather shifts as you make your way through the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No map, no markers, just you and your lantern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/e46cd60ae7af6f8b86a3a3edb57f5280.mp4?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Drowning Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remains of a flooded hamlet lay inland from the shore. Walkways collapse, water laps at your feet, and things don\u2019t stay the same as you left them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental challenges to progress through the floodwaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stave off the hallucinations of the village's previous inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack crates and debris to reach higher ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore basements, corridors, and homes lost to the sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/519ba303730e8bf7edf8631c3f591618.mp4?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Beacon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse still towers above the ruins. Weather-beaten, gutted, but somehow still running.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the drowned dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find notes and defenses left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way to the top of the last lighthouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/cee44879831100e312215b14d7fa8c14.poster.avif?t=1747599491\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/cee44879831100e312215b14d7fa8c14.webm?t=1747599491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_